"Takes installs it for you from Anthropic, then Terminal opens so you can sign in." = "Takes menginstalnya untuk Anda dari Anthropic, lalu Terminal terbuka agar Anda dapat masuk.";
"Takes installs it for you from Anthropic, then you sign in once. No password, nothing to type." = "Takes menginstalnya untuk Anda dari Anthropic, lalu Anda masuk sekali. Tanpa kata sandi, tanpa mengetik apa pun.";
"Terminal opens and takes you to your browser to sign in. Nothing to type." = "Terminal terbuka dan membawa Anda ke browser untuk masuk. Tanpa mengetik apa pun.";
"The download took too long, so Takes stopped it. Check your internet connection, then try again." = "Unduhan terlalu lama, jadi Takes menghentikannya. Periksa koneksi internet Anda, lalu coba lagi.";
"There isn't enough free space on this Mac to install Claude Code. Free some up, then try again." = "Ruang kosong di Mac ini tidak cukup untuk menginstal Claude Code. Kosongkan sedikit ruang, lalu coba lagi.";
"This takes about a minute. Then Terminal opens so you can sign in." = "Prosesnya sekitar satu menit. Lalu Terminal terbuka agar Anda dapat masuk.";
"This text can't be edited. Take %lld is on the clipboard: press ⌘V" = "Teks ini tidak dapat diedit. Versi %lld ada di papan klip: tekan ⌘V";
"a temporary folder" = "folder sementara";
"Allow Takes under System Settings › General › Login Items." = "Izinkan Takes di Pengaturan Sistem › Umum › Item Login.";
"Also the hotkey of “%@”." = "Juga tombol pintas “%@”.";
"Also used by %@. Pick another, or turn that one off." = "Juga digunakan oleh %@. Pilih yang lain, atau matikan yang itu.";
"Also used by %@. Pick another." = "Juga digunakan oleh %@. Pilih yang lain.";
"Claude Code %@ is too old; update it (claude update)" = "Claude Code %@ terlalu lama; perbarui (claude update)";
"Claude Code couldn't start" = "Claude Code tidak dapat dimulai";
"Claude Code didn't answer" = "Claude Code tidak menjawab";
"Claude Code didn't answer. Check again in a moment." = "Claude Code tidak menjawab. Periksa lagi sebentar lagi.";
"Claude Code didn't answer; trying again" = "Claude Code tidak menjawab; mencoba lagi";
"Copies Takes to the Applications folder and opens it from there" = "Menyalin Takes ke folder Aplikasi dan membukanya dari sana";
"Couldn't copy Takes to Applications: %@" = "Tidak dapat menyalin Takes ke Aplikasi: %@";
"Couldn't set this: %@" = "Tidak dapat mengatur ini: %@";
"Couldn't start" = "Tidak dapat dimulai";
"Didn't answer" = "Tidak menjawab";
"Free hotkeys" = "Tombol pintas yang bebas";
"Free right now:" = "Bebas saat ini:";
"Move Takes to Applications" = "Pindahkan Takes ke Aplikasi";
"Move Takes to Applications first; macOS doesn't keep login items for an app run from %@." = "Pindahkan Takes ke Aplikasi dulu; macOS tidak menyimpan item login untuk app yang dijalankan dari %@.";
"Open Takes when I log in" = "Buka Takes saat saya login";
"Pick a different shortcut, or turn the other one off in that app or in System Settings › Keyboard › Keyboard Shortcuts." = "Pilih pintasan lain, atau matikan pintasan satunya di app tersebut atau di Pengaturan Sistem › Papan Ketik › Pintasan Papan Ketik.";
"So the hotkey is ready without opening Takes first. Change it any time in Settings › General." = "Agar tombol pintas siap tanpa perlu membuka Takes dulu. Ubah kapan saja di Pengaturan › Umum.";
"something that isn't Takes is already at %@" = "sesuatu yang bukan Takes sudah ada di %@";
"Sorry about that. Reporting it helps fix it: Takes opens a bug report on GitHub with where it stopped, and shows the full crash report in Finder to attach." = "Maaf soal itu. Melaporkannya membantu memperbaikinya: Takes membuka laporan bug di GitHub berisi tempat ia berhenti, dan menampilkan laporan crash lengkap di Finder untuk dilampirkan.";
"Takes is already in Applications." = "Takes sudah ada di Aplikasi.";
"Takes is running from %@. Move it first, so the access you allow stays with it." = "Takes berjalan dari %@. Pindahkan dulu, agar akses yang Anda izinkan tetap melekat padanya.";
"Takes is running from %@. Move it to Applications first, so the access you allow stays with it." = "Takes berjalan dari %@. Pindahkan dulu ke Aplikasi, agar akses yang Anda izinkan tetap melekat padanya.";
"Takes is still looking for Claude Code on this Mac." = "Takes masih mencari Claude Code di Mac ini.";
"Takes was copied to Applications but couldn't be opened from there. Open it from Applications yourself." = "Takes sudah disalin ke Aplikasi tetapi tidak dapat dibuka dari sana. Buka sendiri dari Aplikasi.";
